                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-32-reg&quot;>Working at AbbVie Switzerland offers you all the advantages of a globally successful biopharmaceutical company. We provide our employees with good framework conditions to develop professionally and personally. Take your opportunity and get to know a special company with a unique working environment.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
