                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>At AbbVie Switzerland, we work together to develop innovative medicines for the future. Fair remuneration for our employees is important to us: That's why you can expect a performance-related bonus in addition to your salary if you achieve agreed targets. We offer this model for all positions across all company levels.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
