                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T14:43:52.970-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>At AbbVie, everyone works in teams. This requires an open communication culture and flexibility in the organisation of working hours. This improves the quality of life of employees and helps to retain talent within the company. The &amp;quot;meeting-free Friday&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;flexible working&amp;quot; established in Switzerland are particularly popular with our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
