                                        langAttribute="none"
                                        text="&lt;p>In 2026, AbbVie Switzerland was given the award Great Place to Work Switzerland for the&amp;nbsp;twelfth time as one of the best employers in the large-sized company category.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
