                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>AbbVie is a place where development is lived. We offer you attractive opportunities for development within the company and a wide range of further training programmes in Switzerland and internationally. As part of the global team, you will also have the opportunity to gain experience abroad. Both permanent and short-term assignments are possible. You will get to know different branches and experience different working cultures on site.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
